MegaSAM tracking integration
---------------------------
Source: https://github.com/mega-sam/mega-sam
The existing in-tree MegaSAM/DROID runtime is completed with a Python tracking
function adapted from test_demo.py, preserving depth alignment and camera-to-world
conversion. Reconstruction debug exports and shell/demo execution are removed.
The original Apache-2.0 license and Eigen/lietorch license files accompany the
source; CUDA extensions share the existing Eigen headers.


